# The deployed site is a small set of self-contained pages: every capture is
# embedded as a data URI, so none of the source material needs to be served.
# Upload only the pages (and vercel.json, which Vercel reads from the root).
#
# Re-including a file inside an excluded directory needs the directory itself
# re-included first, which is why 6-personas gets its own pair of rules.
*
!research
research/*
!research/research.html
!research/6-personas
research/6-personas/*
!research/6-personas/personas.html
!vercel.json
